1
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:33,000
There are no bad dogs, just bad owners.

2
00:08:54,000 --> 00:09:00,000
Good Boy is a comedy, horror, thriller film directed by Tyler MacIntyre.

3
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:27,000
When Maggie gets an emotional support dog to help quell some of her anxiety,
she finds him to be even more effective than she imagined...

4
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
because unbeknownst to her, he kills anyone who adds stress to her life.

5
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Maggie, played by Judy Greer.

6
00:26:42,000 --> 00:26:48,000
Annie, played by Ellen Wong.

7
00:31:09,000 --> 00:31:15,000
Nate, played by McKinley Freeman.

8
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Don, played by Steve Guttenberg.

9
00:40:03,000 --> 00:40:09,000
Dr. Linda Johnson, played by Elise Neal.

10
00:44:30,000 --> 00:44:36,000
Bea, played by María Conchita Alonso.

11
00:48:57,000 --> 00:49:03,000
Honey Boy is a 2019 American drama film directed by Alma Har'el and written by Shia
LaBeouf, loosely based on his childhood and his relationship with his father.

12
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
The film stars LaBeouf, Lucas Hedges, Noah Jupe and FKA Twigs.

13
00:57:51,000 --> 00:57:57,000
LaBeouf originally wrote the script as a form of therapy while in rehab.

14
01:02:18,000 --> 01:02:24,000
The project was announced in March 2018, and the cast
was filled out over the next two months.

15
01:06:45,000 --> 01:06:51,000
Filming took place in Los Angeles over the course of about three weeks.

16
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
Honey Boy had its world premiere at the Sundance Film Festival on January 25,
2019, and was released on November 8, 2019, by Amazon Studios.

17
01:15:39,000 --> 01:15:45,000
The film received largely positive reviews from critics, who praised Har'el's
direction as well as the performances of LaBeouf, Hedges and Jupe.

18
01:20:06,000 --> 01:20:12,000
The film explores themes of holiday, pet, animal attack, dog, animal horror.

19
01:24:33,000 --> 01:24:39,000
The tone is dark and lighthearted and emotional.
